  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oxfam 2025-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Oxfam 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rehabilitating basic services and building resilience of conflict-affected communities in Aleppo Governorate during the period July 2025-June 2027. The project includes support for the rehabilitation of water systems, local-level projects to contribute to increased social cohesion, and support for livelihoods, primarily in agriculture.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rehabilitering av grundl&#xE4;ggande samh&#xE4;llstj&#xE4;nster och uppbyggnad av motst&#xE5;ndskraft i konfliktdrabbade samh&#xE4;llen i Aleppo-provinsen under perioden juli 2025&#x2013;juni 2027. Projektet omfattar bl a st&#xF6;d till rehabilitering av vattensystem, projekt p&#xE5; lokal niv&#xE5; f&#xF6;r att bidra till &#xF6;kad social sammanh&#xE5;llning samt st&#xF6;d till f&#xF6;rs&#xF6;rjningsm&#xF6;jligheter, fr&#xE4;mst inom jordbruket.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance the resilience and well-being of crisis-affected population, IDPs, and returnees by ensuring sustainable access to Water, Sanitation, and Hygiene (WASH) services, fostering social cohesion and psychological resilience, and strengthening livelihoods for improved living conditions.</narrative>
  </description>
